  message: "Root-novelty (human-adjudicated): INSTANCE of WI-kutas generate-schema-drift root — codegen emitted const:'behavior_map' from the dataclass default instead of an enum. Distinct fix (emit enum) keeps it a separate row, but it is the same generator root, not a new root."  # 1112
