- op: discuss  # 9028
  at: '2026-07-09T20:59:11Z'  # 9028
  by: agent  # 9028
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 9028
  clock: 4  # 9028
  nonce: '9028'  # 9028
  message: "Fixed + merged (selfh/dev 5eec6c2f29). docs/schema.json pinned the top-level 'view' field to const 'behavior_map', so compact/tiered projections (view='compact'/'tiered') failed JSON-Schema validation on that field. Now an enum single-sourced from a new schema.VIEW_NAMES tuple (behavior_map/compact/tiered) that generate-schema enumerates. RESCOPED per scope-audit: the item statement was over-broad (claimed slice/test-coverage also fail identically — FALSE; only compact/tiered are behavior_map projections retaining the required envelope). Backward-compatible enum widening → no SCHEMA_VERSION bump. Behavioral evidence: new test validates each projected view name against the view sub-schema (+ rejects a bogus view); test_schema_matches_generated + version tests stay green; 3464 affected tests pass; core 100%. Wave-4 schema."  # 9028
